 "summary": "VMContext embedded `Table` can be out-of-sync",
 "description": "### Summary\r\n\r\nFor a table with fixed number of elements, we intentionally embed the `Table` as part of the `VMContext`. However, the table elements might end up out-of-sync for some operations like:\r\n - from the host through `Table::set` or `Table::copy`\r\n - by another Wasm instance importing the same table - including its element initialization\r\n\r\n### Details\r\n\r\nDescribed already.\r\n\r\n### Proof of concept\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n### Impact\r\n\r\nA low impact.",
